    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23655212"
    description: "Zenodo archive of FlashWAF v1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-26
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/apandya55/flash-waf-sim"
abstract: >-
  Python simulator for page allocation, out-of-place updates, greedy garbage
  collection, and modeled page-program amplification. Includes reproducible
  synthetic experiments with raw outputs and analysis scripts. Results describe
  this simulator and do not predict physical NAND device behavior.
keywords:
  - NAND flash
  - flash translation layer
  - FTL
  - page-mapped FTL
  - write amplification
  - garbage collection
  - greedy garbage collection
  - out-of-place updates
  - workload locality
  - storage systems
  - research software
  - simulation
  - Python
